      "feature": "main",
      "operation": "INTERSECTION",
      "modifications": "Original planar vertices/edges/wire/mkplane become skPolyline/skSolve on the same plane and opExtrude with the same sweep; no operand replacement. One original unit is one millimeter. The second profile uses local coordinates (y,z) on x=0 and sweeps +x by sqrt(2). The original trotate is a proper rigid opPattern transform about the same axis/center/angle; delete only the unrotated instance before the original Boolean. ",
      "originalOracles": {
        "areaCommand": "checkprops result -s 4.41421",
        "areaMm2": 4.41421,
        "areaAbsoluteToleranceMm2": 5e-06,
